SECTION 0 — EXECUTIVE PURPOSE, MODULE 2 BOUNDARIES, DESIGN PRINCIPLES, AND SQL SECTION MAP
****************************************************************************************************

PROJECT CONTEXT:
    Enterprise Credit Decisioning Strategy Simulator

COMPLETED UPSTREAM MODULE:
