    13. Matched baseline / challenger applicant rows are available when readiness permits.
    14. Portfolio-level baseline and challenger summaries are available.
    15. Portfolio-level challenger-minus-baseline delta summaries are available.
    16. Decision outcome migration matrix is available.
    17. Matched applicant-level delta sample is available.
    18. Product-level strategy movement diagnostics are available.
    19. Score-band strategy movement diagnostics are available.
    20. Product × score strategy movement diagnostics are available.
    21. Reason-code distribution and movement diagnostics are available.
    22. Simulated offer-exposure transition diagnostics are available.
    23. Approved exposure movement diagnostics are available.
    24. Approved Expected Loss movement diagnostics are available.
    25. Matched source-field consistency diagnostics are available.
    26. Compact Section 13 readiness recap is available.

Section 13 established:
    1. Governed comparison selection through the persistent comparison campaign registry.
    2. Archive inventory visibility.
    3. Comparison readiness visibility.
    4. Applicant-level matched comparison helper table.
    5. Outcome migration diagnostics.
    6. Segment-level comparison diagnostics.
    7. Reason-code movement diagnostics.
    8. Offer-exposure, approved-exposure, and approved Expected Loss transition diagnostics.
    9. Immutable source-field consistency diagnostics.
    10. Compatibility outputs needed by Section 14 matched comparison readiness review.

No archive rows have been inserted.
No archive rows have been deleted.
No archive rows have been updated.
No latest-run rows have been modified.
No decision outcomes have been recalculated.
No simulated reason codes have been recalculated.
No approved exposure has been recalculated.
No requested or approved Expected Loss values have been recalculated.
No strategy parameters have been modified.
No product-policy parameters have been modified.
No full Module 2 QA framework has been created.
